<body class="paper" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f6f3ee;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;">Choose a new password. The link works once.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" class="paper" style="background-color:#f6f3ee;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" class="wrap" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;">
<tr><td style="padding:0 4px 16px 4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><span class="mark" style="font-size:20px;line-height:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.3px;color:#1b1a17;">Needt</span></td></tr>
<tr><td class="card pad" bgcolor="#fffdf9" style="background-color:#fffdf9;border:1px solid #e7e2d9;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<h1 class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:28px;font-weight:700;color:#1b1a17;">Reset your password</h1>
<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1b1a17;">Hi Alex,</p><p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1b1a17;">We received a request to reset the password for your Needt account. If you did not make it, you can ignore this email and nothing changes.</p><table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px 0;"><tr><td class="btn" bgcolor="#1b1a17" style="background-color:#1b1a17;border-radius:10px;"><a href="https://use.needt.app/auth/reset-password?token=SAMPLE" class="btn-a" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#fffdf9;text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">Choose a new password</a></td></tr></table><p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6a665e;">Button not working? Paste this link into your browser:<br><a href="https://use.needt.app/auth/reset-password?token=SAMPLE" class="muted" style="color:#6a665e;word-break:break-all;">https://use.needt.app/auth/reset-password?token=SAMPLE</a></p><p class="muted" style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6a665e;">This link works once and expires on Wednesday, October 28, 2026 at 12:00 PM.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="muted" style="padding:16px 4px 0 4px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6a665e;">You get this because of activity on your Needt account.<br>Needt &middot; [OWNER: legal entity name and postal address]</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>",
  "subject": "Reset Your Needt Password",
  "text": "Reset your password

Hi Alex,

We received a request to reset the password for your Needt account. If you did not make it, you can ignore this email and nothing changes.

Choose a new password: https://use.needt.app/auth/reset-password?token=SAMPLE

This link works once and expires on Wednesday, October 28, 2026 at 12:00 PM.

--
You get this because of activity on your Needt account.
Needt - [OWNER: legal entity name and postal address]",
}
`;

