<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1b1a17;">We could not confirm your university email this year.</p><p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1b1a17;">From your renewal on 26 Nov 2026, Needt Pro is the regular price, $59 / year.</p><p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1b1a17;">Still a student? Add your university email again in Settings, Plan, before that date. No university email? Write to students@needt.app with proof of enrolment.</p><table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px 0;"><tr><td class="btn" bgcolor="#1b1a17" style="background-color:#1b1a17;border-radius:10px;"><a href="https://use.needt.app/settings?section=billing" class="btn-a" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#fffdf9;text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">Open Settings</a></td></tr></table><p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6a665e;">Button not working? Paste this link into your browser:<br><a href="https://use.needt.app/settings?section=billing" class="muted" style="color:#6a665e;word-break:break-all;">https://use.needt.app/settings?section=billing</a></p><p class="muted" style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6a665e;">You can cancel any time in Settings, Plan &amp; billing, Invoices and payment.</p>
</td></tr>
