<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1b1a17;">Hi Alex,</p><p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1b1a17;">Confirm your email to open Needt and start 14 days of Pro, no card needed.</p><table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px 0;"><tr><td class="btn" bgcolor="#1b1a17" style="background-color:#1b1a17;border-radius:10px;"><a href="https://use.needt.app/auth/confirm-email?token=SAMPLE" class="btn-a" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#fffdf9;text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">Confirm email</a></td></tr></table><p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6a665e;">Button not working? Paste this link into your browser:<br><a href="https://use.needt.app/auth/confirm-email?token=SAMPLE" class="muted" style="color:#6a665e;word-break:break-all;">https://use.needt.app/auth/confirm-email?token=SAMPLE</a></p><p class="muted" style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6a665e;">This one-time link expires in 24 hours. If you did not create a Needt account, you can ignore this email.</p>
</td></tr>
